our big matrix after all of the transformations have been completed. Therefore, \n\n$$\n{A}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -15 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$"}]}
